unit: pc-onprem-followups
commits: 265118f98 (OCR cleanup presents the daemon's own key), 0cbc69c2c
  (the CLI presents SOVEREIGN_API_KEY), 6686bef8e (no web offer without a
  web-reaching tool), aee8ca125 (sealed absences name what the box can do),
  a64befcc3 (rustfmt), 9b3905bed (SYSTEM_OVERVIEW + kit README)
what: on a keyed daemon the OCR cleanup call is admitted by a per-process
  self credential in the one key store; `svrn corpus watch*` sends
  SOVEREIGN_API_KEY; a turn whose registry reaches no web search carries no
  web offer in its system message or `search` description; every sealed 503
  points at /v1/conversations and `/v1/mcp/servers` agrees with `/mcp`.
  Decision: ralph/decisions/phase-c-5.md.
